OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome showers
OL,6,Fthis evening, some heavy with chance
OL,7,Fof thunder especially over Northern
OL,8,FAngus. The showers mostly dying out
OL,9,Fovernight, though staying mostly
OL,10,Fcloudy with just a few clear intervals.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA mainly dry start with a
OL,13,Ffew sunny intervals then cloud
OL,14,Fincreasing to bring a few showers from
OL,15,Flate morning. Showers fading later
OL,16,Fwith some sunny intervals returning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
